      "id": 120,
      "text": "Andreas Antonopoulos, the author of our source material, has a golden rule that every user has to memorize. Let's hear it."
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "text": "Your keys, your coins. Not your keys, not your coins. Your keys, your coins. Exactly. Not"
    },
